---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ArrowUpRight, Compass, Code2, Layers } from 'lucide-react';
import catalog from '../../data/catalog.json';
const icons = [Compass, Code2, Layers];
---

<Base title="学习路线" section="roadmaps"
  ><div class="container page-content">
    <div class="page-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">LEARNING PATHS / 学习路线</span><h1>找到起点，然后向前一步。</h1><p>
        按你的基础与目标选择路线。每个节点都有学习材料和完成标准，<br
        />你可以按顺序探索，也可以从已经遇到的问题出发。
      </p>
    </div><div class="roadmap-cards">
      {
        catalog.roadmaps.map((r, i) => {
          const Icon = icons[i];
          return (
            <a class={`roadmap-card roadmap-card-${i}`} href={`/roadmaps/${r.id}/`}>
              <>
                <div class="card-top">
                  <>
                    <Icon size={27} />
                    <span class="card-number">{r.number}</span>
                  </>
                </div>
                <div class="card-kicker">{r.subtitle}</div>
                <h3>{r.title}</h3>
                <p>{r.description}</p>
                <div class="card-bottom">
                  <>
                    <span>
                      {r.level}
                      <i />
                      {r.duration}
                    </span>
                    <ArrowUpRight size={18} />
                  </>
                </div>
              </>
            </a>
          );
        })
      }
    </div><section class="note-panel">
      <h2>怎样使用一条路线？</h2><div class="three-notes">
        <div>
          <b>01 · 先看目标</b><p>阅读每个节点的完成标准，确认它与你想解决的问题有关。</p>
        </div><div>
          <b>02 · 做一个小实践</b><p>看完材料后做一次练习。遇到知识缺口，再回到前置节点。</p>
        </div><div><b>03 · 留下结果</b><p>勾选完成，并在自己的笔记中保存输出、失败与改进。</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div></Base
>
